    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "Turn the clock back to 2015. What problem was Knowledge Distillation actually trying to solve?",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "Knowledge distillation trains a smaller student model to match the softened outputs of a larger teacher. The soft probabilities carry class-similarity information that hard labels do not expose.",
            "sourceIds": ["source-distilling-the-knowledge-in-a-neural-network"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "That sounds like a promising direction. What mechanism actually makes it work?",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "A teacher produces softened logits, and the student learns from both those soft targets and the original labels.",
            "sourceIds": ["source-distilling-the-knowledge-in-a-neural-network"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "Why did the idea outlive one paper or experiment? What did later researchers actually inherit?",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "Experts generally treat knowledge distillation as a standard model-compression and transfer technique. Its long-term legacy is the teacher-student pattern now used for efficient inference, ensembles, and large-model adaptation.",
            "sourceIds": ["source-distilling-the-knowledge-in-a-neural-network"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "SUMMARY",
            "text": "Knowledge Distillation mattered not only as a result, but as a method that later researchers could test, adapt, and extend.",
